  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 506.04 Sale on Credit. No wholesale distributor licensee shall sell beverage on credit except to those persons holding New Hampshire retail or wholesaler licenses and then in accordance with RSA 179:13.\n\nSource. (See Revision note at chapter heading for Liq 500) #5043, eff 1-11-91; ss by #5180, eff 7-22-91; ss and moved by #6391, eff 11-28-96 (from Liq 506.05), EXPIRED: 11-28-04\n\nNew. #8450, eff 10-21-05; ss by #10647, eff 7-24-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
